flowchart TD
  A([Draft estimate:<br/>lines and pricing]) --> B{Send for<br/>signature}
  B -->|e-sign| B1[Envelope: priced<br/>lines and date required]
  B -->|outside Compass| B2[Mark sent<br/>outside Compass]
  B1 --> C[signature_pending]
  B2 --> C
  C --> D{Accepted by}
  D -->|e-sign webhook| G
  D -->|manual: attestation<br/>and evidence| E{Contract already<br/>accepted?}
  E -->|no| G
  E -->|yes, approver chooses| F[Change order:<br/>contract_version difference<br/>or replacement]
  F --> G[acceptProjectEstimate:<br/>older versions superseded,<br/>accounting ready]
  G --> H[Rebuild contract budget:<br/>new current revision]
  H --> I[Optional contract packet<br/>signed or executed]
  I --> J([Job status changed<br/>by a person])
